+	  Motorola PowerStack and IBM RS/6000 4x/7xxx models with i8259
+	  interrupt controller.  The firmware residual data is passed to the
+	  kernel by the dtbImage.prep bootwrapper.  Motorola Raven/Hawk boards
+	  with OpenPIC and SMP are not supported.
